public static int interpretStringToInt(String str) {
    int result = 0;
    int multiplier = 1;

    for (int i = str.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        char ch = str.charAt(i);
        int digit = ch - '0';

        result += digit * multiplier;
        multiplier *= 10;
    }

    return result;
}
```

**Explanation:**

